          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Yes, can you give me some info about the Metropolitan Museum of Art and other museums in New York City?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some information about the Metropolitan Mueseum of Art and other ones in New York City?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "The Metropolitan Museum of Art, known as The Met, is a must-visit for art lovers, with a vast collection ranging from Ancient Egyptian artifacts to modern works. It's located across from Central Park and offers both self-guided and guided tours; tickets can be purchased online to skip lines [DOC-2][DOC-3]. For quieter or more specialized experiences, consider the Morgan Library and Museum, which is ideal for book collectors, or the Museum of the City of New York, which focuses on the city's rich history [DOC-1][DOC-3]. Other notable museums include the American Museum of Natural History, the New-York Historical Society, and the Brooklyn Museum. NYC's museum scene is incredibly diverse, so you can find institutions dedicated to everything from art and history to photography and architecture [DOC-3]. Do you want advice on quieter times to visit popular museums?",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0035-35-01717:6": 0.04463488017658188,
