          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful, thanks! Can you give me some information about the Metropolitan Museum of Art and other museums in New York City?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some information about the Metropolitan Mueseum of Art and other ones in New York City?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "The Metropolitan Museum of Art (the Met) is the largest art museum in the U.S., featuring over two million works spanning 5,000 years. New York City also offers other top museums like the American Museum of Natural History, the Brooklyn Museum, and the Museum of the City of New York, many of which provide quieter, educational experiences. Are you interested in museum passes or discounts for multiple attractions?",
