          "text": "The Metropolitan Museum of Art is one of the largest and most visited art museums in the world. It can get quite crowded, especially on weekends and during peak travel seasons. However, it's worth noting that the museum has a vast collection and a large building, so even with a lot of visitors, you can still find some quiet spots to enjoy the art. It's a good idea to plan your visit in advance, consider visiting during less busy times, and take advantage of the museum's audio guides or guided tours to make the most of your visit. Additionally, the museum has wheelchair accessibility and offers programs for individuals with disabilities.",
