          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s actually really helpful. Could you tell me about the main museums in New York City, like the Metropolitan Museum of Art? What kind of collections do they have?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some information about the Metropolitan Mueseum of Art and other ones in New York City?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "The Metropolitan Museum of Art is one of the world's largest and finest art museums, with a collection spanning 5,000 years of world culture. It includes renowned paintings, as well as items like porcelain, musical instruments, historical artifacts, costumes, and armaments. The museum is divided into various sections, featuring Medieval Art, Greek and Roman Art, The American Wing, and Asian Art, among others. With over two million works of art, it's a must-visit destination for art enthusiasts. As someone who prefers quiet museums, you'll likely appreciate the vast and diverse collections on display.",
