          "user_utterance": "Thanks! Can you give me some information about the Metropolitan Mueseum of Art and other ones in New York City?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some information about the Metropolitan Mueseum of Art and other ones in New York City?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "The Metropolitan Museum of Art (The Met) is the largest art museum in the Western Hemisphere, housing over two million works spanning 5,000 years of art history. It has a main building on Museum Mile and a second location, The Cloisters, for medieval art. Other major NYC art museums include the Museum of Modern Art (MoMA), known for 20th and 21st-century art, and the Solomon R. Guggenheim Museum, famous for its modern collection and unique architecture. New York also offers diverse museums like the American Museum of Natural History and the Brooklyn Museum.",
