          "user_utterance": "Hey! I want to know how to get ready for a trip to New York. Anything I need to keep in mind?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to prepare for a trip to New York?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To prepare for your New York trip, pack layers and comfortable walking shoes, checking the weather for appropriate clothing, and always carry an umbrella. For safety, be aware of your surroundings, keep belongings secure (a zippered cross-body purse is recommended), and use cards over cash as NYC is very card-friendly. Plan ample time for sightseeing, visit popular attractions early to avoid crowds, and utilize the extensive subway system. Remember to check bag policies for museums and venues.",
