          "user_rubrik": "Can you recommend some places in New York City where I can train for my 10km race?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For training for your 10km race in New York City, consider Central Park, a runner's paradise with various loops including a 6-mile option. Flushing Meadow Park is also great, known for its 10K race course. Other excellent options include the Hudson River Greenway, which offers long stretches along the water, and Brooklyn Bridge Park, where you can run across the iconic bridge.",
