          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m planning a trip to New York. Any tips on how to get ready for it?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to prepare for a trip to New York?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For your New York trip, prioritize comfortable walking shoes and pack layered, weather-appropriate clothing, including waterproof items and a day bag. Get a MetroCard for easy subway travel, which is the best way to get around. Save money by exploring free attractions and consider a New York Pass for popular sites. For safety, be aware of your surroundings and avoid carrying excessive cash. Don't forget earbuds for city noise and a refillable water bottle. Also, check bag policies for museums.",
