          "user_utterance": "Thanks, that\u2019s super helpful! Can you give me some info about the Metropolitan Museum of Art and other ones in New York City?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you give me some information about the Metropolitan Mueseum of Art and other ones in New York City?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "The Metropolitan Museum of Art (The Met) is the largest art museum in the Western Hemisphere, located on Museum Mile along Central Park. It houses over two million works spanning 5,000 years of world culture, including ancient Egyptian, European, and Asian art. The Met also has The Cloisters for medieval art and The Met Breuer. Other notable NYC museums include the Museum of Modern Art (MoMA), the Guggenheim, the Brooklyn Museum, and the Museum of the City of New York.",
