          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To prepare for your New York trip, research the city, plan your budget, and book flights and accommodations early. Pack layers, comfortable walking shoes, an unlocked phone, and a portable charger. Consider getting a 7-day subway pass for easy transportation. Also, be mindful of safety tips and use cards over excessive cash, as NYC is a card-friendly city.",
