          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s a bit general. Can you give me specific tips for things to pack and how to save money on transportation?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to prepare for a trip to New York?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For packing, prioritize comfortable walking shoes and layered clothing, checking the weather. An umbrella, a day bag or backpack, and a reusable water bottle are also highly recommended. Consider a folding reusable bag for purchases. To save on transportation, utilize New York's extensive subway and bus systems. A 7-day MetroCard offers unlimited travel and can be a cost-effective option.",
